  "authorship": "New source extraction, preparation recipe and profile prepared with Claude for this repository, 2026-11-05. Axis calibration derived from the page by scripts/bw_expansion/extract_graphs.py. No donor stock curves copied: this sheet publishes its own C, M and Y dye curves plus a visual neutral. New profile preparation and profile data released under CC BY-SA 4.0."
